title: 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_영문
---
(Friday's 3rd period feels like the most exhausting class of the entire week.)
(EunPyo is in the lecture hall.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: I really hope this class ends soon...
{name()}: Me too. What are you doing this weekend?
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: To be honest... I'm planning on staying cooped up at home all day watching anime.
{name()}: That sounds just like you.
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 50>> 
    <<show pyo_blush>>
    EunPyo: Or, maybe we could hang out together?
    EunPyo: If you call me, I'll come out.
<<endif>>
(We chatted for a bit until the professor arrived.)
(Once class started, the wave of exhaustion hit me,)
(And I closed my eyes for a moment—no, my eyes just closed on their own.)
(...)
Professor: {name()}, please answer question 2-4.
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: (whispering) {name()}! Wake up...!
{name()}: ……Huh?
(Did they say 2-3?)
<<choice 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_긍1_영문 "Say anything." 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_부1_영문 "Stay silent.">>
(I don't know the answer. Should I just say something?)
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_긍1_영문
---
{name()}: Uh... I think it's Stockholm Syndrome...?
(My voice got smaller and smaller as I spoke.)
Professor: ...
<<jump 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_부1_영문
---
{name()}: ... ...
Professor: {name()}? Are they not here?
<<jump 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_강의실_서은표_분기1_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: The answer is Lima Syndrome.
{name()}: !
Professor: Correct.
(The professor continued the lecture with a satisfied smile at the answer.)
{name()}: (whispering) Wow, that scared me.
{name()}: Thanks for covering for me....
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 60>>
    <<show pyo_blush>>
    <<like 서은표>>
    <<change lvPyo +10>>
    <<play 서은표_흠>>
    EunPyo: If it's for you, I can always find my courage.
    (EunPyo was visibly shy.)
    (I could tell she really summoned her courage, especially since she usually struggles even to order food.)
<<endif>>
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: If you're still tired, you can sleep a bit more.
{name()}: No, I'm wide awake now. I should listen to the class.
(We focused on the rest of the lecture together.)
<<end>>
===